    "title": "AI Baby Generator - Face Maker",
    "description": "Have you ever thought How will my baby look like? If yes, then this application \u201cAI Baby Generator: Face Maker\u201d is perfect for you. \r\n\r\n\u201cAI Baby Generator:  Face Maker\u201d app uses advanced artificial intelligence (AI) algorithm technologies to analyze the faces of Mommy and Daddy and generate an image of your baby. You can see the baby face with this app. Our\u00a0baby maker app\u00a0generates accurate results.\r\n\r\n\u201cAI Baby Generator:  Face Maker\u201d app consists of 2 features:-\r\n\r\n<b>1- Future Baby Generator  (Make a baby)</b>\r\n\u25c6 Choose photos of Dad.\r\n\u25c6 Choose photos of Mom.\r\n\u25c6 Press on the \u201cBaby Maker\u201d button and wait for a second. Baby Maker will use the artificial intelligence and make a baby for you.\r\n\r\n<b>2- Analyse Child (Future Baby Predictor percentage)</b>\r\n\u25c6 Choose photos of Dad.\r\n\u25c6 Choose photos of Mom.\r\n\u25c6 Choose photos of your cute baby.\r\n\u25c6 Press on the \u201cCheck Analyse Child\u201d button and wait for a second. Baby Maker will use the artificial intelligence and analyse the percentage of Mom and Dad match with your baby.\r\n\r\nFuture Baby Generator is now simple and you need to keep below points in mind to achieve the best results:\r\n\u25c6 The images are of high quality, good lighting condition.\r\n\u25c6 Face looking directly at the camera.\r\n\u25c6 Face without beard.\r\n\u25c6 Choose Baby\u2019s skin tone.\r\n\r\nFind out how you and your partner's baby face can look like!!! Try it with your boyfriend's/girlfriend's photo and amaze your partner and friends with Future Baby Face Generator!\r\n\r\nCheck it now this Baby Maker app and make a baby face for fun!!!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Have you ever thought How will my baby look like? If yes, then this application \u201cAI Baby Generator: Face Maker\u201d is perfect for you. <br><br>\u201cAI Baby Generator:  Face Maker\u201d app uses advanced artificial intelligence (AI) algorithm technologies to analyze the faces of Mommy and Daddy and generate an image of your baby. You can see the baby face with this app. Our\u00a0baby maker app\u00a0generates accurate results.<br><br>\u201cAI Baby Generator:  Face Maker\u201d app consists of 2 features:-<br><br><b>1- Future Baby Generator  (Make a baby)</b><br>\u25c6 Choose photos of Dad.<br>\u25c6 Choose photos of Mom.<br>\u25c6 Press on the \u201cBaby Maker\u201d button and wait for a second. Baby Maker will use the artificial intelligence and make a baby for you.<br><br><b>2- Analyse Child (Future Baby Predictor percentage)</b><br>\u25c6 Choose photos of Dad.<br>\u25c6 Choose photos of Mom.<br>\u25c6 Choose photos of your cute baby.<br>\u25c6 Press on the \u201cCheck Analyse Child\u201d button and wait for a second. Baby Maker will use the artificial intelligence and analyse the percentage of Mom and Dad match with your baby.<br><br>Future Baby Generator is now simple and you need to keep below points in mind to achieve the best results:<br>\u25c6 The images are of high quality, good lighting condition.<br>\u25c6 Face looking directly at the camera.<br>\u25c6 Face without beard.<br>\u25c6 Choose Baby\u2019s skin tone.<br><br>Find out how you and your partner&#39;s baby face can look like!!! Try it with your boyfriend&#39;s/girlfriend&#39;s photo and amaze your partner and friends with Future Baby Face Generator!<br><br>Check it now this Baby Maker app and make a baby face for fun!!!",
